                    "multiple": false,
                    "typeClass": "primitive",
                    "value": "Basak, S. (corresp. author), Rajendran, S., Pollin, S., Scheers, B. (2023). Autoencoder based framework for drone RF signal classification and novelty detection. In: <i>2023 25TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON ADVANCED COMMUNICATION TECHNOLOGY, ICACT</i>, (218-225). Presented at the 25th International Conference on Advanced Communication Technology (ICACT) - New Cyber Security Risks for Enterprise Amidst COVID-19 Pandemic, SOUTH KOREA, Pyeongchang, 19 Feb 2023-22 Feb 2023. ISBN: 979-11-88428-10-6. doi: 10.23919/ICACT56868.2023.10079363"
